  "description": "A durable Entity Framework Core idempotency store for OrionOnce. Persists idempotency keys, their in-flight lease, and the captured response across instances, with an atomic insert-wins AcquireAsync over a unique key constraint and a bulk-delete SweepAsync. References EntityFrameworkCore.Relational only, so the consumer chooses the database provider.",
